==============
What is OS ?
============

=> OS stands for Operating System

=> It is software which acts as a mediator between user and computer

=> Users communicate with computers using OS

=> Without an operating system, we cannot normally use a computer to run applications

=> OS provides a platform to run applications on a computer

```
    Ex: Notepad, Calculator, Browser, Tomcat, Eclipse,
        Java applications, Docker, Jenkins etc...
```

=> We have several operating systems in the market

```
    Ex: Windows, Linux, macOS, Android, iOS etc...
```

===========
